/*
 * MapExpander — expands map operations into YIL instructions.
 *
 * The MapExpander lowers high-level map operations into concrete YILValue
 * and YILInstr nodes. It handles:
 *
 *   - map access(MAP_FIND),
 *   - map containment checks,
 *   - map insertion,
 *   - map iterator begin/end/next,
 *   - iterator key/value extraction.
 *
 * Map access produces option values. Iterator operations emit runtime calls
 * to the Ymir runtime map API.
 *
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::lint::expander::value::map
 * @File: ymirc/lint/expander/value/map.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-06-23
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
